owledge"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Data Analysis"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Policy Research"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Real Projects"},{"text":">"},{"text":"Generic Certificates"}]}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A B.Plan is a relevant undergraduate foundation. For policy-heavy roles, postgraduate study can significantly strengthen the candidate."},{"type":"table","header":["PG Area","Relevance"],"rows":[[{"text":"M.Plan Housing"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"M.Plan Urban & Regional Planning"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"M.Plan Urban Planning"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Public Policy"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Urban Economics"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Development Studies"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Housing / Real Estate Studies"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Urban Analytics"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"GIS / Geoinformatics"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Transport Planning"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Environmental Planning"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended path"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Plan","Housing + GIS + Economics","Housing Research Internship","Junior Planning / Policy Analyst","M.Plan / Public Policy / Urban Economics"]},{"type":"p","text":"OR"},{"type":"flow","items":["Industry Experience","Housing Policy Analyst","Senior Housing Policy Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"An M.Plan or policy/economics-oriented master's is strongly useful but not universally mandatory for entry-level research roles."}]},{"heading":"Specialization Paths","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Path A — Affordable Housing Policy"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Plan","Housing Economics","Affordability Analysis","Housing Programmes","Affordable Housing Policy Analyst","Housing Policy Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"Path B — Housing + GIS"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Plan","GIS","Housing Data","Spatial Affordability Analysis","Housing Analytics Specialist","Housing Policy Analyst"]},{"type":"p","text":"Best for candidates who enjoy data and mapping."},{"type":"h","text":"Path C — Housing Economics"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Plan","Economics","Housing Markets","Land Economics","Housing Market Analyst","Housing Policy Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"This path benefits substantially from postgraduate study in economics, urban economics or public policy."},{"type":"h","text":"Path D — Housing + Transport"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Plan","Housing Planning","Transport Accessibility","TOD","Integrated Housing Strategy","Urban Development Policy Analyst"]},{"type":"h","text":"Path E — Housing + Social Policy"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Plan","Urban Sociology","Housing Inequality","Informal Settlements","Community Development","Housing / Social Policy Specialist"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Housing Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Large datasets can help analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Housing prices"},{"text":"Rental markets"},{"text":"Household characteristics"},{"text":"Vacancy"},{"text":"Development patterns"},{"text":"Housing affordability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Geospatial AI"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Informal settlements"},{"text":"New development"},{"text":"Land-use change"},{"text":"Housing density"},{"text":"Building footprints"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Satellite / GIS Data","Computer Vision / AI","Building + Land-Use Detection","Housing Database","Policy Analysis"]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Urban Digital Twins"},{"type":"p","text":"Housing data can be integrated with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Population"},{"text":"Transport"},{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"Land use"},{"text":"Employment"},{"text":"Environmental data"},{"text":"to model different development scenarios."}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Scenario Modelling"},{"type":"p","text":"Future planning workflows increasingly test:"},{"type":"p","text":"Scenario A"},{"type":"flow","items":["Affordable Housing + Transit","Housing Outcomes"]},{"type":"p","text":"Scenario B"},{"type":"flow","items":["Peripheral Expansion","Infrastructure + Transport Costs"]},{"type":"p","text":"Scenario C"},{"type":"flow","items":["Infill Development","Land + Infrastructure Efficiency"]},{"type":"p","text":"The analyst compares the outcomes before recommending a policy direction."},{"type":"h","text":"5. AI-Assisted Policy Research"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can help with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Document analysis"},{"text":"Data exploration"},{"text":"Scenario generation"},{"text":"Literature review"},{"text":"Policy comparison"},{"text":"But recommendations should remain grounded in verified data, legislation, economic evidence and stakeholder realities."}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Minimum employability stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Plan"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Housing Planning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Housing Economics Fundamentals"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Demography"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"QGIS / ArcGIS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Policy Research"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Data Visualization"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Housing Research Project"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Relevant Internship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong candidate stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Plan"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Housing Policy"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Housing Economics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Advanced GIS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"SQL + PostGIS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Python + GeoPandas"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Demographic Analysis"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Affordability Modelling"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Programme Evaluation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Transport Accessibility"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Land-Use Planning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Policy Writing"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Data Visualization"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Housing Policy Internship"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to take a housing problem from raw data to an evidence-based policy recommendation."},{"type":"flow","items":["Population + Household Data","Housing Stock","Housing Demand","Housing Supply","Affordability Analysis","Spatial / GIS Analysis","Policy Problem","Alternative Interventions","Cost + Benefit + Equity Analysis","Recommended Policy","Implementation Framework","Monitoring Indicators"]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio target"},{"type":"p","text":"Build 5–6 substantial projects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Housing affordability analysis"},{"text":"Housing demand forecast"},{"text":"Affordable housing strategy"},{"text":"Rental housing policy study"},{"text":"Transit-oriented housing analysis"},{"text":"Housing programme evaluation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Each project should contain:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research question"},{"text":"Data sources"},{"text":"Methodology"},{"text":"GIS analysis"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Findings"},{"text":"Policy alternatives"},{"text":"Evaluation criteria"},{"text":"Recommendation"},{"text":"Implementation indicators"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest professional profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Housing Policy Analyst","Urban Planning","GIS","Housing Economics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"rather than simply:"},{"type":"h","text":"Planner interested in housing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"The key differentiator is the ability to connect housing data, economics, spatial patterns and public policy."},{"text":"Urban Planning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Housing Economics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Demography"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Policy Analysis"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Programme Evaluation","Housing Policy Analyst"]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a realistic progression toward Housing Policy Analyst → Senior Housing Policy Specialist → Housing Strategy Lead → Urban Development / Housing Policy Advisor, with adjacent opportunities in affordable housing, urban analytics, housing research, public policy, development consulting and integrated housing-transport planning."}]}]}